Source: Department of State, Central Files, 320/7–2858. Confidential. Drafted by
                        IO/UNP;
                    cleared with Monsma, Nunley, Ludlow, Bacon, Kerley, Westfall, S/AE, OES, and ODA;
                    and initialed for the Secretary by Adams.
                    Sent to 73 posts; and repeated to 11 diplomatic posts and 4 consular posts.
